 Weissman. <year>2003</year>. Characterization of mouse clonogenic megakaryocyte progenitors. <source>Proc. Natl. Acad. Sci. USA.</source> <volume>100</volume>:<fpage>205</fpage>&#x02013;210.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12490656</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>